    "id": "tn_kdvWYCnmQ"
   },
   "source": [
    "## 6.Creating Prediction Results\n",
    "Finally, let's make a prediction for the test data, and prepare a CSV file to submit."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
