    "### 6.3 Saving this notebook as a ZIP file [REQUIREMENT IF AIMING FOR HONORS/OUTSTANDING STUDENTS]\n",
    "This section compresses the notebook file (`tutorial.ipynb`) into a ZIP file and saves it to your working directory.\n",
    "Make sure to save the notebook (Ctrl+S or Cmd+S) before running this cell to include the latest changes.\n",
    "\n",
    "If you are aiming to become **Honors or Outstanding Student**, you need to submit the ZIP file as well on Omnicampus."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 130,
   "metadata": {
    "executionInfo": {
     "elapsed": 25479,
     "status": "aborted",
     "timestamp": 1791935544430,
     "user": {
      "displayName": "木村進太郎",
